I don't think there is one.  Even nymphs have to hit a monster to
steal an object.  Hitting the priest will upset it.  To get their
spellbooks, convince a powerful pet to kill the priest for you.  The
ghosts are NOT something you need to worry about, and thus not what I
consider a "negative consequence".  They are very slow and easy enough
to kill with a normal weapon.

Stand outside the temple and kill it from afar.  Sure, you'll lose
telepathy, but floating eyes aren't that hard to kill if you can take
on a priest and live to tell the tale.

